# Advanced engineering collections are reservation-only init substrates.
# `.gitkeep` makes the opted-in directory durable in Git without claiming a
# schema, lifecycle, mutator, or index implementation that does not exist yet.
# Existing contents (notably legacy fixes/F<N>.md records) are never touched.
